msgstr "问：CMake 找不到软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:111 9a14af6189dd4aa79dad5d80da288175
msgid ""
"Build from a workspace that already ran `./init_repo.sh`. If `ros2` / "
"`colcon` is missing, finish [Install "
"Environment](2-install_environment.md) first. After a successful build, "
"`source install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal."
msgstr ""
"在已经跑过 `./init_repo.sh` 的工作区构建。若缺少 `ros2` / `colcon`，先完成 "
"[安装环境](2-install_environment.md)。构建成功后，在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:113 f4c5bb597d4f4145a9573b625edbc407
msgid "Q: Build runs out of memory"
msgstr "问：编译时内存不足"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:115 15121d22e6e14765bd69b8fe37efe45b
msgid "Limit parallel jobs:"
msgstr "限制并行任务数："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:117 b4b10312098142c8be3f2bb79b9c62be
msgid "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"
msgstr "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:121 ec98edcd527244c0863e3c960ad164e2
msgid "Or build specific packages:"
msgstr "或者只编译指定软件包："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:123 98da2aa41adf4553b0220483d3d01d9b
msgid "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"
msgstr "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:127 c67eda88aa2f4b2e9c347f50716b2797
msgid "Runtime Issues"
msgstr "运行时问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:129 c52472b6eb8948a285f3bbd1ab4743c8
