msgid "Q: Isaac Sim won't start or scripts fail"
msgstr "问：Isaac Sim 无法启动或脚本失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:208 7bf0b9533a074d9f8829be8903455255
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** `./init.sh` / `./run.sh`. Default Isaac path is "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim` unless overridden in "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`). Version for the optional Isaac ROS 2 "
"workspace comes from the `./init.sh` operation 2 menu (GitHub tags; "
"fallback in `config/fa_sim.conf`: `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`) — do not "
"assume a single hardcoded minor version."
msgstr ""
"使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 的 `./init.sh` / `./run.sh`。默认 Isaac 路径是 "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR`（除非在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 覆盖，否则为 `~/isaacsim`）。可选 "
"Isaac ROS 2 工作空间版本来自 `./init.sh` 操作 2 菜单（GitHub tag；回退见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`：`6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`）— 不要假定某一个写死的次版本号。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:210 9d680ebe72d3477fba96816e185dc66c
msgid ""
"Confirm the directory in `ISAACSIM_DIR` exists and contains the launch "
"scripts named in `config/fa_sim.conf` (`isaac-sim.sh`, …)"
msgstr "确认 `ISAACSIM_DIR` 目录存在，且包含 `config/fa_sim.conf` 中的启动脚本（`isaac-sim.sh` 等）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:211 105e1b4ba6af4231b17aa0ae81d29279
msgid ""
"Copy `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → `config/fa_sim.local.conf` if "
"Isaac is not at `~/isaacsim`"
msgstr ""
"若 Isaac 不在 `~/isaacsim`，复制 `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:212 7eb370a4778c4d2c934920df72138ec2
msgid ""
"Re-run `./run.sh` and pick PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming from the "
"menu (`./run.sh` has no `--headless` / `--robot` flags)"
msgstr ""
"再跑 `./run.sh`，从菜单选 PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming（`./run.sh` 没有 "
"`--headless` / `--robot` 参数）"

